      <abstract>&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Moose, the post-modern kick-ass object system for Perl 5&lt;/p&gt;      </abstract>
      <description>&#xA;&lt;p&gt;If you haven&amp;#39;t tried playing with the Moose by now, you should start!&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Moose is a feature-rich completely-kickass object system for Perl 5 that provides the&#xA;best object framework one might ever need.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;We&amp;#39;ll start by drooling over all the things Moose provides that Perl 5 - and most other&#xA;languages - do not provide.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;A sense of accomplishment is guaranteed!&lt;/p&gt;      </description>
